  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;LADY ANNE WODEHOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Anne Wodehouse is a member of the Wodehouse family and has recently married Carole Madge Warrand de Montmorency, a respected figure in the de Montmorency clan."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAROLE MADGE WARRAND DE MONTMORENCY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carole Madge Warrand de Montmorency is a respected figure in the de Montmorency clan and has recently married Lady Anne Wodehouse."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY VICTORIA WODEHOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Wodehouse is Anne's cousin and expresses joy for the union between Anne and Carole."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is a leading expert on British aristocracy and comments on the union between Anne and Carole."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WODEHOUSE FAMILY ESTATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Wodehouse family estate is the location of the intimate ceremony where Lady Anne Wodehouse and Carole Madge Warrand de Montmorency got married."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DE MONTMORENCY CLAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The de Montmorency clan is a prominent family that Carole Madge Warrand de Montmorency belongs to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON SOCIAL SCENE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The London social scene is where Carole Madge Warrand de Montmorency has been a fixture for years due to her philanthropic work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIGH-PROFILE CHARITY GALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A high-profile charity gala is mentioned as the place where Anne and Carole first bonded over their shared passion for social justice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARL OF DERBY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Earl of Derby is a nobleman who hosts a ball where Anne and James first meet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Earl of Derby is the host of the ball where Anne and James first met."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KNOWSLEY HALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Knowsley Hall is the location of the ball where Anne and James first meet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Knowsley Hall is the venue of the ball where Anne and James first met."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LORD WODEHOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lord Wodehouse is Anne's cousin and writes a letter expressing initial surprise but eventual acceptance of James as part of the family."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lord Wodehouse is one of the witnesses to Anne and James's marriage, as mentioned in the Marriage Certificate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY KING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady King is James's mother and is mentioned as one of the witnesses to the marriage certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lady King is another witness to Anne and James's marriage, as mentioned in the Marriage Certificate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANNE WODEHOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anne Wodehouse is a member of the Wodehouse family and is described as a member of the peerage with a tradition of nobility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAMES CARLETON KING&quot;">
